      "writtenOn": "2019-04-03T14:33:14Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Done. I\u0027ve added a tracker and initialized it to the same quota value as the encap sockets.\n\nI\u0027d be against initializing it to the rlimit of FDs, as I think that makes it less readable - Having a quota tracker implies a limited quantity of a resource, while setting it to the rlimit of FDs implies that it\u0027s basically infinite.",
      "parentUuid": "f862f050_3069707e",
      "range": {
