      "writtenOn": "2019-02-26T02:28:38Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "1. It looks like we don\u0027t pass fd to verify the ownership here.\nThe problem is more likely to my self, but please help to answer it if you know that:\nIs it any case that resourceId is correct but fd is fake?\n\n2. do we need to say throws IllegalArgumentException and/or RemoteException?",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 1902,
        "startChar": 28,
        "endLine": 1902,
        "endChar": 59
      },
      "revId": "c99ea44577aa0c6763f7f34e05affe6069a24162",
